        "hide": "=action3Description = null or action3Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Type:** {{action3Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action3Description}}\n\n**Responsable suggéré:** {{action3Owner}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action3Deadline}}\n\n**Ressources demandées:** {{action3Resources}}\n\n**Indicateurs de succès:** {{action3KPI}}",
