        "row": "Row_Budget_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Budget_Summary"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep2"
    },
    {
      "text": "## ⚠️ Évaluation des risques",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Risques Action 1",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk1_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "**Risques identifiés:** {{risk1Description}}\n\n**Probabilité:** {{risk1Probability}} | **Gravité:** {{risk1Severity}}\n\n**Mesures de mitigation:** {{risk1Mitigation}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Details",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk1_Details"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Risques Action 2",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk2_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk2_Header",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=risk2Description = null or risk2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Risques identifiés:** {{risk2Description}}\n\n**Probabilité:** {{risk2Probability}} | **Gravité:** {{risk2Severity}}\n\n**Mesures de mitigation:** {{risk2Mitigation}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk2_Details",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk2_Details",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=risk2Description = null or risk2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "### Risques Action 3",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk3_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk3_Header",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=risk3Description = null or risk3Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Risques identifiés:** {{risk3Description}}\n\n**Probabilité:** {{risk3Probability}} | **Gravité:** {{risk3Severity}}\n\n**Mesures de mitigation:** {{risk3Mitigation}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk3_Details",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk3_Details",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=risk3Description = null or risk3Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Niveau de risque global:** {{globalRiskLevel}}\n\n**Risques résiduels:** {{residualRisks}}\n\n**Recommandations:** {{riskRecommendations}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk_Global",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk_Global"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep3",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep3"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 💰 Allocation des ressources",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header3",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Allocation_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "En tant que manager/direction, validez et allouez les ressources nécessaires pour chaque action.",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Instructions",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Instructions"
    },
    {
      "text": "### 💵 Allocation Action 1",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Alloc1_Header"
    },
    {
      "label": "Budget alloué (Action 1)",
      "type": "textfield",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Budget",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Budget",
      "key": "allocatedBudget1",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "description": "Montant en devise locale (ex: 5000 EUR)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Responsable confirmé (Action 1)",
      "type": "textfield",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Owner",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Owner",
      "key": "confirmedOwner1",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "description": "Nom et prénom du responsable final",
      "defaultValue": "=action1Owner"
    },
    {
      "label": "Personnel additionnel (Action 1)",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Team",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Team",
      "key": "additionalTeam1",
      "description": "Noms des personnes affectées en support",
      "rows": 2
    },
    {
      "label": "Équipements/Outils alloués",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Equipment",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Equipment",
      "key": "allocatedEquipment1",
      "description": "Matériel, logiciels, outils nécessaires",
      "rows": 2
    },
    {
      "label": "Statut de disponibilité",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "✅ Ressources disponibles immédiatement",
          "value": "available"
        },
        {
          "label": "⏳ Ressources disponibles sous conditions",
          "value": "conditional"
        },
        {
          "label": "❌ Ressources insuffisantes",
          "value": "insufficient"
        }
      ],
      "type": "select",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Status",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Status",
      "key": "resourceStatus1",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "label": "Conditions ou commentaires",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Alloc1_Comments",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Alloc1_Comments",
      "key": "allocationComments1",
      "description": "Précisions, conditions, contraintes",
      "rows": 3
    },
